1362
01:03:38,960 --> 01:03:41,200
The overall process of making changes to

1363
01:03:41,200 --> 01:03:43,760
a Tadwig vocabulary is governed by the

1364
01:03:43,760 --> 01:03:46,640
vocabulary maintenance specification and

1365
01:03:46,640 --> 01:03:49,599
is summarized in this diagram.

1366
01:03:49,599 --> 01:03:52,240
Any person or group may propose changes

1367
01:03:52,240 --> 01:03:54,000
or additions.

1368
01:03:54,000 --> 01:03:56,160
Periodically, the maintenance group

1369
01:03:56,160 --> 01:03:58,319
responsible for the vocabulary will

1370
01:03:58,319 --> 01:04:00,319
review proposals in light of three

1371
01:04:00,319 --> 01:04:02,079
criteria.

1372
01:04:02,079 --> 01:04:05,359
Demand by the community, efficacy to

1373
01:04:05,359 --> 01:04:08,160
meet an identified need, and whether the

1374
01:04:08,160 --> 01:04:10,160
change will maintain stability of

1375
01:04:10,160 --> 01:04:13,119
existing implementations.

1376
01:04:13,119 --> 01:04:15,520
Proposed changes meeting these criteria

1377
01:04:15,520 --> 01:04:17,599
are approved by the maintenance group to

1378
01:04:17,599 --> 01:04:20,559
undergo a 30-day public comment period

1379
01:04:20,559 --> 01:04:22,559
during which consensus about the

1380
01:04:22,559 --> 01:04:25,760
proposal is sought. If consensus is

1381
01:04:25,760 --> 01:04:28,000
achieved, the executive committee makes

1382
01:04:28,000 --> 01:04:29,680
sure that the procedures have been

1383
01:04:29,680 --> 01:04:32,160
followed properly and ratifies the

1384
01:04:32,160 --> 01:04:35,160
change.

1385
01:04:37,520 --> 01:04:39,920
More complicated changes that go beyond

1386
01:04:39,920 --> 01:04:42,480
the basic bag of terms layer of the

1387
01:04:42,480 --> 01:04:45,200
vocabulary are known as vocabulary

1388
01:04:45,200 --> 01:04:46,799
enhancements.

1389
01:04:46,799 --> 01:04:49,039
Because they're more complicated, it's

1390
01:04:49,039 --> 01:04:51,680
required that user feedback documents be

1391
01:04:51,680 --> 01:04:54,000
submitted with the proposal to make it

1392
01:04:54,000 --> 01:04:55,839
clear that the package of changes are

1393
01:04:55,839 --> 01:05:00,160
needed and will work as described.

